<h2 id=3D"optimization">Optimization</h2>
<p>We can optimize our solution by understanding that, for each cell in the=
 DP table, we only need to access the cells directly above it and to its le=
ft.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
